          "Text": "Outpost Hope's Quartermaster appears to be busying himself with tallying up charts and tables on a terminal, while dispatching terse and pointed holocommunication messages now and then. He barely glances up as another enters his armory, though one may notice that he has an exceptionally well-made pistol in holster that is never quite far away from his reach. \"Are you authorized to be here? If not, leave me be, for I am busy. This Outpost won't run itself, you know. Speak to Corporal Gurmonna if you need anything.\"",
